            <span class="help-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-life-preserver" aria-hidden="true"></i> JOBTRACKER WORKSPACE GUIDE</span>
            <h1>Get your workshop ready</h1>
            <p>A practical guide to setting up master data and maintaining product manufacturing definitions. This guide will grow alongside the application.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="help-hero-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i class="bi bi-journal-text"></i></div>
    </header>

